    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc40 &quot;Eye On The World&quot; is a casual exploration adventure game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/c8a3ab493c8fa02c1415b59c6a6bbdc5.poster.avif?t=1742031626\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/c8a3ab493c8fa02c1415b59c6a6bbdc5.webm?t=1742031626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/c8a3ab493c8fa02c1415b59c6a6bbdc5.mp4?t=1742031626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf89Congratulations, you have been appointed as the town's special probation officer!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a town where surveillance cameras have been installed all over the place to maintain security. Suddenly, you are assigned the task of observing the town, and you will use the images from the surveillance cameras to protect the town's safety by searching for lost children, finding lost items, and searching for cats that live in the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to complete your missions smoothly, but you will gradually begin to feel a sense of discomfort with the town and the world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you will start to feel something strange about the town and the world, and when you have completed all the missions, you will discover the mystery of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eye On The World&quot; is an exploration adventure game in which you will find various objects in an exciting world made of voxels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is different from picture books and game books that focus on exploration, as the depth and three-dimensionality of the digital 3D world stimulates surprise, inspiration, and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's challenge everyone to a world of fun exploration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b It is recommended to play this game in full screen mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0e Convenient help system</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have a convenient help system in case you get stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/7dc8eac45cb9444d899284289faeff57.poster.avif?t=1742031626\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/7dc8eac45cb9444d899284289faeff57.webm?t=1742031626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/7dc8eac45cb9444d899284289faeff57.mp4?t=1742031626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0e Convenient zoom function</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A zoom function is provided so that you can search for things carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/66000a5ba18cb22d10548dfb03571532.poster.avif?t=1742031626\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/66000a5ba18cb22d10548dfb03571532.webm?t=1742031626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/66000a5ba18cb22d10548dfb03571532.mp4?t=1742031626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf9\ufe0f About Video Distribution</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regardless of individuals or corporations, distribution is possible without permission. Monetization is only possible when using the features provided by the video distribution site. It would be appreciated if you could include the name of the game in the title of the video and in the streaming, or add a link to the Steam page in the description. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refrain from the following actions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Broadcasting games with content or purposes that violate public order and morals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Advocating political beliefs, religious beliefs, or hate speech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Acts of defamation against the game posters or other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, we will not be responsible for any damages caused by the distribution of videos of this game. The contents of this guideline may be changed without notice.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc40 &quot;Eye On The World&quot; is a casual exploration adventure game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/c8a3ab493c8fa02c1415b59c6a6bbdc5.poster.avif?t=1742031626\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/c8a3ab493c8fa02c1415b59c6a6bbdc5.webm?t=1742031626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/c8a3ab493c8fa02c1415b59c6a6bbdc5.mp4?t=1742031626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf89Congratulations, you have been appointed as the town's special probation officer!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a town where surveillance cameras have been installed all over the place to maintain security. Suddenly, you are assigned the task of observing the town, and you will use the images from the surveillance cameras to protect the town's safety by searching for lost children, finding lost items, and searching for cats that live in the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to complete your missions smoothly, but you will gradually begin to feel a sense of discomfort with the town and the world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you will start to feel something strange about the town and the world, and when you have completed all the missions, you will discover the mystery of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eye On The World&quot; is an exploration adventure game in which you will find various objects in an exciting world made of voxels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is different from picture books and game books that focus on exploration, as the depth and three-dimensionality of the digital 3D world stimulates surprise, inspiration, and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's challenge everyone to a world of fun exploration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b It is recommended to play this game in full screen mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0e Convenient help system</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have a convenient help system in case you get stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/7dc8eac45cb9444d899284289faeff57.poster.avif?t=1742031626\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/7dc8eac45cb9444d899284289faeff57.webm?t=1742031626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/7dc8eac45cb9444d899284289faeff57.mp4?t=1742031626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0e Convenient zoom function</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A zoom function is provided so that you can search for things carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/66000a5ba18cb22d10548dfb03571532.poster.avif?t=1742031626\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/66000a5ba18cb22d10548dfb03571532.webm?t=1742031626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476760/extras/66000a5ba18cb22d10548dfb03571532.mp4?t=1742031626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf9\ufe0f About Video Distribution</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regardless of individuals or corporations, distribution is possible without permission. Monetization is only possible when using the features provided by the video distribution site. It would be appreciated if you could include the name of the game in the title of the video and in the streaming, or add a link to the Steam page in the description. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refrain from the following actions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Broadcasting games with content or purposes that violate public order and morals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Advocating political beliefs, religious beliefs, or hate speech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Acts of defamation against the game posters or other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, we will not be responsible for any damages caused by the distribution of videos of this game. The contents of this guideline may be changed without notice.</p>",
